1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,697
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,697 --> 00:00:05,327
IVY: Hey! That's not fair! Otto got more!

3
00:00:05,527 --> 00:00:08,982
OTTO: I counted eleven acorns. You have ten!

4
00:00:09,382 --> 00:00:15,662
OTTO: One, two, three, four, five, six.

5
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:20,040
OTTO: Seven, eight, nine, ten, eleven!

6
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:24,436
Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

7
00:00:24,836 --> 00:00:28,361
The last number tells how many. Ten!

8
00:00:28,761 --> 00:00:31,383
Both have ten. It's B!

9
00:00:31,783 --> 00:00:33,279
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

10
00:00:34,779 --> 00:00:37,662
OTTO: Now let's count your spines, Bramble!

11
00:00:37,862 --> 00:00:40,509
BRAMBLE: I have about five thousand.

12
00:00:40,709 --> 00:00:43,749
OTTO: One, two, three... maybe tomorrow!

13
00:00:44,149 --> 00:00:49,234
Say it with me. The last number tells how many.

14
00:00:49,634 --> 00:00:52,953
Next case: a missing house number.

